      "text": "1-System Administration\n2-Docker image - build\n3-Virtualize\n4-Docker-compose\n5-Penultimate\n6-Dockerfile\n7-Container\n8-DockerContainer\n9-NGINX\n10-TLS\n11-php-fpm\n12-MariaDB\n13- Wordpress volume\n14-Docker Named Volumes\n15-Bind mount\n16-Docker-network",
